    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open your eyes, you find yourself on a familiar stairs. You are trapped in a school where time seems to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From somewhere, you hear a voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one of the classrooms, a girl stands quietly. Even when you try to speak to her, she does not respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the empty school building, your only option is to head for the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNO LIFE BABY OF THE END\u201d is a walking simulator set in a school overrun by zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to your surroundings  and make your way to the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/c8b7084a242e3e24d1b30c3a1e18c9a8.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/bdc8bafbd5b33d484e9218ee5aac9f42.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/0c0750ecd1c42259f1a2113103188363.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you open your eyes, you find yourself on a familiar stairs. You are trapped in a school where time seems to have stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From somewhere, you hear a voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In one of the classrooms, a girl stands quietly. Even when you try to speak to her, she does not respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alone in the empty school building, your only option is to head for the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cNO LIFE BABY OF THE END\u201d is a walking simulator set in a school overrun by zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to your surroundings  and make your way to the rooftop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/c8b7084a242e3e24d1b30c3a1e18c9a8.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/bdc8bafbd5b33d484e9218ee5aac9f42.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949560/extras/0c0750ecd1c42259f1a2113103188363.avif?t=1747041520\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p>",
